  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Title: Industrial application of 9801 propylene de-arsenic catalyst</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The first industrial application of 9801 propylene de arsenic catalyst in Harbin Petrochemical Company was described.Operating result showed that the catalyst has high activity for arsenic removal from propylene,which well meets the requirement of high efficiency catalyst on quality of propylene feedstock.The catalyst is also featured by low cost,simplicity in use and mild operation condition,with no special requirement for use.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

