<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#Publication_51">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#Publication"/>
  <reportsReaction rdf:resource="#reaction_instance_51"/>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Publication_51</rdfs:label>
  <openalexId rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">W2371061238</openalexId>
  <score rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.9844845</score>
  <publicationDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2005-01-01</publicationDate>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Title: The research and progress in selective catalytic reduction of NO_x</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This paper introduced latest advances of reducing agent included CxHy,NH3,CO(NH2)2 and so on,and introduced several kinds of catalysts used active carbon, zeolite, metal oxides, cordierite, multiple carrier as carriers in selective catalytic reduction of NOx.The advantages and disadvantages of catalyst and reducing agent were discussed. The selective catalytic reduction of removing nitrogen oxides using urea as reducing agent and using multiple carrier catalysts will become a popular subject.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

