  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Title: Progress in hydrogen production from steam reforming of hydrocarbons</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Steam reforming of hydrocarbons is the main method for the large-scale production of hydr gen.The research advance on hydrogen production from steam reforming of hydrocarbons,especially tl catalyst and process was reviewed.The development trend of the steam reforming of hydrocarbons was al outlined.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

